        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Classroom Function Door Knob for Panic Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis heavy duty Classroom Function Door Knob (Outside knob locked and unlocked by Key)  is suitable for all Wide and Medium  Stile Doors (aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  For use on door's exterior with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device Hardware</b></a>.  Covers standard 2-1/8\" bore hole prep. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200r\"><b>4200 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-vertical-rod-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200v\"><b>4200 Series Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-vertical-rod-exit-device-pdq-4200v-b605\"><b>Polished Brass Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-rim-exit-device-pdq-4200r-b605\"><b>Polished Brass Rim Exit Device</b></a>, \r\n Global <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbar\"><b>TH1100EDTBAR Touch Bar Rim Exit Device</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-grade-2-surface-vertical-rod-door-panic-device-th1100edsvtbar\"><b>TH1100EDSVTBAR Surface Vertical Rod Panic Device</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/classroom-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-4-sh-08-phl\"><b>Classroom Function Lever for Panic Device</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/passage-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-4-sh-14-phl\"><b>Non Locking Passage Lever for Panic Device</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for PDQ 4-K-08-630  Keyed Classroom Function Knob\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Classroom Function (ANSI F08) - Outside knob locked and unlocked by Key.</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Standard Ball Style Knob</li>\r\n<li><b>Satin Stainless</b> finish</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: Standard Schlage C Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/429CQK.pdf?v=1704262275\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 4-K-08-630 Installation Template & Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
